This directory is an Eclipse p2 update site for distributing the OpenJML
Eclipse plugin. It is published at:

  https://openjml.org/eclipse-update-site

Users install OpenJML into Eclipse via Help > Install New Software, pointing
at the above URL.

Contents:
  features/    -- Feature JAR (org.openjml.OpenJMLFeature_<ver>.jar)
  plugins/     -- Plugin JAR (org.openjml.OpenJMLUI_<ver>.jar)
  site.xml     -- p2 site manifest
  category.xml -- p2 category definition
  artifacts.jar, content.jar -- p2 repository metadata (generated)

The features/ and plugins/ JARs and the metadata JARs are generated artifacts
(listed in .gitignore). They are committed only when publishing a release,
and then in openj.github.io, not here in OpenJMLUpdateSite..

Related directories:
  OpenJMLUI/      -- Plugin source and build scripts
  OpenJMLFeature/ -- Feature descriptor (feature.xml); see its README for the
                     full build and publish workflow
